  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing researcher and journalist collaborations on illicit finance data</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding will foster collaborations between academic researchers and investigative journalism organisations to undertake a set of activities designed to begin unlocking the knowledge currently trapped in the many terabytes of data that have only been superficially analysed, and start to build the required capabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
